Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.46,0:22:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feeling down Because I'm made to be a\Ngirl Which means be caring, be daring,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.72,0:22:45.59,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Because I'm "maid" to be a girl
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.26,0:22:49.31,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Which means, be caring, be daring, and be persevering
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.60,0:22:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And be preserving. Or whatever to have the\Nhappiest life. It's a non-stop mad dash
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.31,0:22:50.31,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Or whatever
