Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.10,0:22:58.19,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Today I step up to become the lead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.04,0:22:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.84,0:23:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't want to know\Nwhere this came from.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.19,0:23:00.11,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}So please, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.08,0:23:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What goes around comes around,\Nyou know, Okachi-machi?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.11,0:23:02.44,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Unlimited! Wanna go wild!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.44,0:23:05.41,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}'Cause I'm a girl after all
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.77,0:23:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm not ever giving it back!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.41,0:23:08.37,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Every day is an all-time high
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.70,0:23:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.10,0:23:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a great panda!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.37,0:23:11.58,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Fresh new anniversaries all year round
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.36,0:23:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could be in a zoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.64,0:23:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would be adored by millions!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.58,0:23:14.33,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Even the unexpected is joyful
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.68,0:23:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about the main\Nattraction at a petting zoo?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.33,0:23:16.71,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Something that spices up romance
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.10,0:23:15.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be great?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.01,0:23:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the proceeds from Maid Sheep.
