Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.60,0:23:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maid Sheep?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.82,0:23:19.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.54,0:23:23.38,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(100,100)}Yes! I declare I'm a girl for life, 'til I die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.36,0:23:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We went and wiped Maid Sheep\Ncompletely out. Bye. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.32,0:23:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So exciting, what a thrill.
